{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# TypeII FlatSpace Correlator Tests\n\nBackground-charge, `dX`, and free-fermion correlator checks.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Needs[\"StringCode`\"];\nStringCode`InitStringCode[<|\"theory\" -> \"TypeII\", \"CFT\" -> \"FlatSpace\", \"conventions\" -> \"TypeII-Ashoke\", \"bracket\" -> \"Flat\"|>];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "allTestsPassed = True;\n\ntestReport[name_, cond_] := Module[{},\n  Print[name, \": \", If[TrueQ[cond], \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\n  If[!TrueQ[cond], allTestsPassed = False];\n  cond\n];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test1 = testReport[\"Test 1 (TypeII H-charge saturation)\", Vev[ToExpression[\"R[expH[{-2,0,0,0,0,0},0]]\"]] === 1];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test2 = testReport[\"Test 2 (wrong H charge vanishes)\", Vev[ToExpression[\"R[expH[{-1,0,0,0,0,0},0]]\"]] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test3 = testReport[\"Test 3 (dX-dX correlator matches Wick)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[dX[mu,0,z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[dX[nu,0,w]]\"]] - Wick[ToExpression[\"dX[mu,0,z]\"], ToExpression[\"dX[nu,0,w]\"]]] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test4 = testReport[\"Test 4 (dXt-dXt correlator matches Wick)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[dXt[mu,0,zb]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[dXt[nu,0,wb]]\"]] - Wick[ToExpression[\"dXt[mu,0,zb]\"], ToExpression[\"dXt[nu,0,wb]\"]]] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test5 = testReport[\"Test 5 (expPhi correlator)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[exp\\\\[Phi]f[-1,z1]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[exp\\\\[Phi]f[-1,z2]]\"]] - 1/(z1 - z2)] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test6 = testReport[\"Test 6 (psi correlator matches Wick)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi][mu,0,z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi][nu,0,w]]\"]] - Wick[ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][mu,0,z]\"], ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][nu,0,w]\"]]] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test7 = testReport[\"Test 7 (psi four-point Wick expansion)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi][mu,0,z1]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi][nu,0,z2]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi][rho,0,z3]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi][sigma,0,z4]]\"]] - (Wick[ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][mu,0,z1]\"], ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][nu,0,z2]\"]] Wick[ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][rho,0,z3]\"], ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][sigma,0,z4]\"]] - Wick[ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][mu,0,z1]\"], ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][rho,0,z3]\"]] Wick[ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][nu,0,z2]\"], ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][sigma,0,z4]\"]] + Wick[ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][mu,0,z1]\"], ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][sigma,0,z4]\"]] Wick[ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][nu,0,z2]\"], ToExpression[\"\\\\[Psi][rho,0,z3]\"]])] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test8 = testReport[\"Test 8 (mixed free and symbolic sectors factorize)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z1], S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, zs]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z2]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z3]]\"]] - (z1 - z2) (z1 - z3) (z2 - z3) Corr[ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, zs]]\"]]] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test9 = testReport[\"Test 9 (dX correlator with right Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[dX[mu,0,z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[dX[nu,0,Infinity]]\"]] + (\\[Alpha]p \\[Delta][mu, nu])/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test10 = testReport[\"Test 10 (dX correlator with left Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[dX[mu,0,Infinity]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[dX[nu,0,z]]\"]] + (\\[Alpha]p \\[Delta][mu, nu])/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test11 = testReport[\"Test 11 (dXt correlator with right Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[dXt[mu,0,zb]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[dXt[nu,0,Infinity]]\"]] + (\\[Alpha]p \\[Delta][mu, nu])/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test12 = testReport[\"Test 12 (dXt correlator with left Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[dXt[mu,0,Infinity]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[dXt[nu,0,zb]]\"]] + (\\[Alpha]p \\[Delta][mu, nu])/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test13 = testReport[\"Test 13 (psi correlator with right Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi][mu,0,z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi][nu,0,Infinity]]\"]] - \\[Delta][mu, nu]/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test14 = testReport[\"Test 14 (psi correlator with left Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi][mu,0,Infinity]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi][nu,0,z]]\"]] + \\[Delta][mu, nu]/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test15 = testReport[\"Test 15 (psit correlator with right Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi]t[mu,0,zb]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi]t[nu,0,Infinity]]\"]] - \\[Delta][mu, nu]/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test16 = testReport[\"Test 16 (psit correlator with left Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi]t[mu,0,Infinity]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[\\\\[Psi]t[nu,0,zb]]\"]] + \\[Delta][mu, nu]/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test17 = testReport[\"Test 17 (expPhi correlator with right Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[exp\\\\[Phi]f[-1,z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[exp\\\\[Phi]f[-1,Infinity]]\"]] + 1] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test18 = testReport[\"Test 18 (expPhi correlator with left Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[exp\\\\[Phi]f[-1,Infinity]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[exp\\\\[Phi]f[-1,z]]\"]] - 1] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test19 = testReport[\"Test 19 (expPhit correlator with right Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[exp\\\\[Phi]tf[-1,zb]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[exp\\\\[Phi]tf[-1,Infinity]]\"]] + 1] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test20 = testReport[\"Test 20 (expPhit correlator with left Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[exp\\\\[Phi]tf[-1,Infinity]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[exp\\\\[Phi]tf[-1,zb]]\"]] - 1] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test21 = testReport[\"Test 21 (mixed c-psi operator at Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z1]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z2], \\\\[Psi][mu,0,z2]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,Infinity], \\\\[Psi][nu,0,Infinity]]\"]] - ((z1 - z2) \\[Delta][mu, nu])/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test22 = testReport[\"Test 22 (mixed c-expPhi operator at Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z], exp\\\\[Phi]f[-1,z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,w]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,Infinity], exp\\\\[Phi]f[-1,Infinity]]\"]] - (w - z)] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test23 = testReport[\"Test 23 (mixed ct-expPhit operator at Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[ct[0,zb], exp\\\\[Phi]tf[-1,zb]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[ct[0,wb]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[ct[0,Infinity], exp\\\\[Phi]tf[-1,Infinity]]\"]] - (wb - zb)] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test24 = testReport[\"Test 24 (full NS operator at Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z], \\\\[Psi][mu,0,z], exp\\\\[Phi]f[-1,z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,w]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,Infinity], \\\\[Psi][nu,0,Infinity], exp\\\\[Phi]f[-1,Infinity]]\"]] - ((z - w) \\[Delta][mu, nu])/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test25 = testReport[\"Test 25 (full antiholomorphic NS operator at Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[ct[0,zb], \\\\[Psi]t[mu,0,zb], exp\\\\[Phi]tf[-1,zb]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[ct[0,wb]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[ct[0,Infinity], \\\\[Psi]t[nu,0,Infinity], exp\\\\[Phi]tf[-1,Infinity]]\"]] - ((zb - wb) \\[Delta][mu, nu])/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test26 = testReport[\"Test 26 (symbolic S sector still factorizes with ghost at Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z1], S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z1]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z2]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,Infinity]]\"]] - (z1 - z2) Corr[ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z1]]\"]]] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test27 = testReport[\"Test 27 (dXt-expX correlator)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[dXt[mu,0,zb]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[expX[k,w,wb]]\"]] - (I \\[Alpha]p k[mu] R[expX[k,0,0]])/(2 (wb - zb))] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test28 = testReport[\"Test 28 (mixed c-expX operator with ghost at Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z1], expX[k,z1,zb1]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z2]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,Infinity]]\"]] - (z1 - z2) R[expX[k,0,0]]] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test29 = testReport[\"Test 29 (mixed c-dX and c-expX with ghost at Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z1], dX[mu,0,z1]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,z2], expX[k,z2,zb2]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[c[0,Infinity]]\"]] + (I \\[Alpha]p k[mu] R[expX[k,0,0]])/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test30 = testReport[\"Test 30 (mixed ct-dXt and ct-expX with ghost at Infinity)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[ct[0,zb1], dXt[mu,0,zb1]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[ct[0,zb2], expX[k,z2,zb2]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[ct[0,Infinity]]\"]] + (I \\[Alpha]p k[mu] R[expX[k,0,0]])/2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## R-sector (Ramond spin field) correlators\n\nGround-state, excited, mixed ψ–S, and BPZ-at-Infinity spin correlators through the bosonization pre-pass.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test31 = testReport[\"Test 31 (Ramond ground-state 2-point <S Sbar> = -I/(z-w)^2)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[S[{{-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2}, \\\"antichiral\\\"}, -3/2, {}, 0, w]]\"]] + I/(z - w)^2] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test32 = testReport[\"Test 32 (spin charge non-saturation vanishes)\", Corr[ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -3/2, {}, 0, w]]\"]] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test33 = testReport[\"Test 33 (excited descendant spin 2-point, exponent 3)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {{1,-1}}, 0, z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -3/2, {}, 0, w]]\"]] - I/(Sqrt[2] (z - w)^3)] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test34 = testReport[\"Test 34 (leftover dH kills the Vev)\", Corr[ToExpression[\"R[dH[1,0,z], expH[{-2,0,0,0,0,0},z]]\"]] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test35 = testReport[\"Test 35 (mixed psi-S 3-point reproduces gamma structure)\", Simplify[Corr[ToExpression[\"R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1, z0], \\[Psi][1, 0, z0]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z1]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z2]]\"]] + (I/2)/((z0 - z1) (z0 - z2) (z1 - z2))] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test36 = testReport[\"Test 36 (mixed psi-S selects a unique spinor partner)\", Corr[ToExpression[\"R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1, z0], \\[Psi][1, 0, z0]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z1]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[S[{{-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2}, \\\"antichiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z2]]\"]] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test37 = testReport[\"Test 37 (BPZ-at-Infinity spin overlap <S@Inf|S@0> = -I)\", Corr[ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, Infinity]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[S[{{-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2}, \\\"antichiral\\\"}, -3/2, {}, 0, 0]]\"]] === -I];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test38 = testReport[\"Test 38 (MultiOp regression for spin correlators)\", Corr[MultiOp[ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[S[{{-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2}, \\\"antichiral\\\"}, -3/2, {}, 0, w]]\"]]] === Corr[ToExpression[\"R[S[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}, \\\"chiral\\\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z]]\"], ToExpression[\"R[S[{{-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2}, \\\"antichiral\\\"}, -3/2, {}, 0, w]]\"]]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test39 = testReport[\"Test 39 (mixed psi-S reproduces package gamma CGamma[mu] with uniform kappa=-I/2)\", Module[{csV, ge, checks}, csV = Join[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}}, Permutations[{1/2,1/2,1/2,-1/2,-1/2}], Permutations[{1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2}]]; ge[mu_,a_,b_] := Simplify[ Corr[R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1,z0], \\[Psi][mu,0,z0]], R[S[{csV[[a]],\"chiral\"},-1/2,{},0,z1]], R[S[{csV[[b]],\"chiral\"},-1/2,{},0,z2]]] ((z0-z1)(z0-z2)(z1-z2)) + (I/2) CGamma[mu][[a,b]] ]; checks = ge @@@ {{1,1,12},{1,8,16},{1,12,1},{6,1,12},{6,2,7},{5,5,4},{10,16,8}}; AllTrue[checks, PossibleZeroQ] ] ];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Symbolic-index R-sector correlators\n\nSpin fields with symbolic spinor/vector indices produce a symbolic gamma-tensor times a z-function (hybrid fit). Correctness is checked by resolving the symbolic output at concrete indices against the numeric correlator; the mixed-chirality two-gamma case is deferred (stays inert).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test40 = testReport[\"Test 40 (symbolic <psi^mu S_a S_b> resolves to numeric correlator on concrete indices)\", Module[{cs, sym, resolved, numeric}, cs = Join[{{1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2,1/2}}, Permutations[{1/2,1/2,1/2,-1/2,-1/2}], Permutations[{1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2,-1/2}]]; sym = Corr[R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1,z0], \\[Psi][mmu,0,z0]], R[S[{aa,\"chiral\"},-1/2,{},0,z1]], R[S[{bb,\"chiral\"},-1/2,{},0,z2]]]; resolved = Private`corrResolveStructure0[sym, <|aa->8, bb->14|>, <|mmu->3|>, {mmu}, <|aa->\"chiral\", bb->\"chiral\"|>]; numeric = Corr[R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1,z0], \\[Psi][3,0,z0]], R[S[{cs[[8]],\"chiral\"},-1/2,{},0,z1]], R[S[{cs[[14]],\"chiral\"},-1/2,{},0,z2]]]; And[Head[sym] =!= Corr, Simplify[resolved - numeric] === 0] ] ];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
